{"id": "EUVD-2026-104311", "enisaUuid": "f9efaf3b-d2de-3386-85df-fb6e97bf4a49", "description": "RisingWave before 3.1.0 contains a missing authorization vulnerability that allows low-privileged SQL users to read and write arbitrary server files by creating posix_fs sources and fs sinks. Attackers holding schema CREATE privilege can set posix_fs.root or fs.path to any directory to read credentials and keys or write files as root.", "datePublished": "2026-10-19T13:55:13", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T19:30:17", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/risingwavelabs/risingwave/pull/25971", "https://github.com/risingwavelabs/risingwave/commit/4603a7ea5cc104fa9ca0779bc459bef630e7f621", "https://github.com/risingwavelabs/risingwave/releases/tag/v3.1.0", "https://github.com/risingwavelabs/risingwave/blob/v3.0.5/src/connector/src/source/filesystem/opendal_source/posix_fs_source.rs", "https://github.com/risingwavelabs/risingwave/blob/v3.0.5/src/connector/src/sink/file_sink/fs.rs", "https://github.com/risingwavelabs/risingwave/blob/v3.0.5/src/frontend/src/handler/create_source.rs", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/risingwave-before-3.1.0-missing-authorization-via-posix-fs-and-fs-connectors"], "aliases": ["GHSA-55ch-h383-9r92", "CVE-2026-112262"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.29, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "40de8928-9746-3691-83b0-65fee0d999f9", "product": {"name": "risingwave", "vendor": {"name": "risingwavelabs"}}, "product_version": "0 <3.1.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "ae42996b-954b-3f7c-b36e-bd781fab654f", "vendor": {"name": "risingwavelabs"}}], "isExploited": false}